 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vsLXmocky5kQ7kNvwE3M5c5&_nc_oc=Adonm_Z51jjJ5JwB8R-EN-GBSNFLt0K20C0ioAIT6EGAeTc6AwGW3yoEcpG4e80RhSA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE2rh0dfRGIN5pkiGJhR5_zAz8vdtWAPxr2nCvkNm3K2w&oe=6A735441"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pKF_jydnAgwQ7kNvwHcW1Kv&_nc_oc=AdqPTh0P4QehXjZ7udTm5tDqqSNF04G95fiAOuKF3BwNYX7LVxwslVWtEn9cWY4ow3s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGUg-MkLxk17V4kYDJVQd5MT1xHS-eaJyQaIqy8THhiHQ&oe=6A732966"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HGlnyqstf2kQ7kNvwENdgoF&_nc_oc=AdrwsnKW_Rq0tliJRSvuRaMmam4edle2rA8gADXIXQ2s-lwrcjJmXu2hmdm_NNpX7DM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHJF05X4GPv_UMhMjibRgW_bwTfNlC7rfzI-IeCZQ3p5A&oe=6A73335C"}, {"fil